---
layout: base.njk
title: Listen
permalink: /listen/
description: "Hear Frank La Rocca's music: selected performances, the composer speaking about his work, and recordings on SoundCloud."
---
<h1>Listen</h1>
<p class="note">For albums, see <a href="/recordings/">Albums</a>; for scores and per-work recordings, see <a href="/works/">Works</a>. More on <a href="{{ site.social.youtube }}">his YouTube channel</a>.</p>

<h2 class="section-title">Selected performances</h2>
<div class="cards three">
{%- for v in videos %}{% if v.selected %}
  <a class="card" href="https://www.youtube.com/watch?v={{ v.id }}"><span class="card-art"><img src="https://img.youtube.com/vi/{{ v.id }}/hqdefault.jpg" alt="" loading="lazy" width="480" height="360"></span><span class="card-title">{{ v.title }}</span><span class="card-meta">{{ v.source }}</span></a>
{%- endif %}{% endfor %}
</div>

<h2 class="section-title">More performances</h2>
<p class="note">Album previews are on the <a href="/recordings/">Albums</a> page.</p>
<div class="cards">
{%- for v in videos %}{% if v.kind == "performance" and not v.selected %}
  <a class="card" href="https://www.youtube.com/watch?v={{ v.id }}"><span class="card-art"><img src="https://img.youtube.com/vi/{{ v.id }}/hqdefault.jpg" alt="" loading="lazy" width="480" height="360"></span><span class="card-title">{{ v.title }}</span><span class="card-meta">{{ v.source }}</span></a>
{%- endif %}{% endfor %}
</div>

<h3 class="section-title" style="font-size:1.5rem">Requiem for the Homeless, movement by movement</h3>
<ul class="dates">
{%- for v in videos %}{% if v.kind == "requiem" %}
  <li><span class="when">Watch</span><div><div class="what"><a href="https://www.youtube.com/watch?v={{ v.id }}" style="text-decoration:none">{{ v.title | replace("Requiem for the Homeless: ", "") }}</a></div></div></li>
{%- endif %}{% endfor %}
</ul>

<div class="inset">
<h2 class="section-title">In his own words</h2>
<p class="note">Lectures and interviews on beauty, conversion, and writing for the liturgy.</p>
<div class="cards three">
{%- for v in videos %}{% if v.kind == "talk" %}
  <a class="card" href="https://www.youtube.com/watch?v={{ v.id }}"><span class="card-art"><img src="https://img.youtube.com/vi/{{ v.id }}/hqdefault.jpg" alt="" loading="lazy" width="480" height="360"></span><span class="card-title">{{ v.title }}</span><span class="card-meta">{{ v.source }}</span></a>
{%- endif %}{% endfor %}
</div>

</div>
<h2 class="section-title">Recordings on SoundCloud</h2>
<div class="embed tall"><iframe loading="lazy" title="Frank La Rocca on SoundCloud" allow="autoplay" src="https://w.soundcloud.com/player/?url=https%3A//soundcloud.com/frank-larocca&color=%23c9a656&auto_play=false&hide_related=true&show_comments=false&show_user=true&show_reposts=false&visual=false"></iframe></div>
<p class="note"><a href="{{ site.social.soundcloud }}">Frank La Rocca on SoundCloud</a></p>
